      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一刹那间，曾国藩似乎觉得位列卿贰的尊贵、京城九市的繁华，都如尘土烟灰一般，一钱不值，人生天地间，唯有这骨肉之间的至亲至爱，才真正永远值得珍惜。",
      "totalCount": 5134
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 24245486,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_66_2811-2823",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "2811-2823",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "扬善于公庭，规过于私室。",
      "totalCount": 4446
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 518203950,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_46_3709-3780",
      "chapterUid": 46,
      "range": "3709-3780",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "读书以训诂为本，作诗文以声调为本，事亲以得欢心为本，养生以戒恼怒为本，立身以不妄语为本，居家以不晏起为本，做官以不要钱为本，行军以不扰民为本。",
      "totalCount": 2856
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 8059143,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_41_8523-8553",
      "chapterUid": 41,
      "range": "8523-8553",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "轻用其芒，动即有伤，是为凶器；深藏若拙，临机取决，是为利器。",
      "totalCount": 2718
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 27785587,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_26_1622-1695",
      "chapterUid": 26,
      "range": "1622-1695",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "最是‘静’字功夫要紧，大程夫子是三代后圣人，亦是‘静’字功夫；王文成亦是‘静’字有功夫，所以他能不动心。若不静，省身也不密，见理也不明，都是浮的。",
      "totalCount": 2355
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 66366922,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_118_2877-2904",
      "chapterUid": 118,
      "range": "2877-2904",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "含刚强于柔弱之中，寓申韩于黄老之内。斯为人为官之佳境。",
      "totalCount": 2214
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 322132954,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_86_5109-5132",
      "chapterUid": 86,
      "range": "5109-5132",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "明用程朱之名分，暗效申韩之法势，杂用黄老之柔弱",
      "totalCount": 2108
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 307995722,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_29_1507-1573",
      "chapterUid": 29,
      "range": "1507-1573",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "要办大事，就得有很多人，人多了，就要有组织；维系这个组织，就要有信仰。至于这个信仰是真理还是谬误，暂时可不管，只要大家相信就可以了。",
      "totalCount": 2055
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 380211870,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_117_4248-4306",
      "chapterUid": 117,
      "range": "4248-4306",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "天下之物，凡加倍磨冶，皆可变换本质，别生精彩，何况人之于学！但能日新又新，百倍其功，何必忧虑不能变化气质，超凡入圣？",
      "totalCount": 2041
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 17400307,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_100_1844-1927",
      "chapterUid": 100,
      "range": "1844-1927",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "读书以训诂为本，作诗文以声调为本，养亲以得欢心为本，养生以少恼怒为本，立身以不妄语为本，治家以不晏起为本，居官以不要钱为本，行军以不扰民为本；孝致祥，勤致祥，恕致祥。",
      "totalCount": 1989
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 219695528,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_23_4406-4416",
      "chapterUid": 23,
      "range": "4406-4416",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "世无艰难，何来人杰？",
      "totalCount": 1980
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 376478846,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_79_7327-7341",
      "chapterUid": 79,
      "range": "7327-7341",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "乱极时站得住，才是有用之学。",
      "totalCount": 1972
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 217777674,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_5_2291-2337",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "2291-2337",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "有子孙，有田园，家风半耕半读，但将箕裘承祖泽；无官守，无言责，世事不闻不问，且将艰巨付儿曹。",
      "totalCount": 1938
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 4700019,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_161_4504-4524",
      "chapterUid": 161,
      "range": "4504-4524",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "家勤则兴，人勤则健。既勤且健，永不贫贱。",
      "totalCount": 1930
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 258351531,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_116_4188-4236",
      "chapterUid": 116,
      "range": "4188-4236",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "邪正看眼鼻，真假看嘴唇，功名看气概，富贵看精神，主意看指爪，风波看脚筋，若要看条理，全在言语中。",
      "totalCount": 1716
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 52764913,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_125_4427-4479",
      "chapterUid": 125,
      "range": "4427-4479",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "越是对方锋芒毕露，越是要柔弱退让，方能显出自己的理直气壮。将欲取之，必先予之。他决定以柔克刚，以退为进。",
      "totalCount": 1710
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 299294250,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_26_5027-5076",
      "chapterUid": 26,
      "range": "5027-5076",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "十多年的官场生涯，使曾国藩深深懂得，当今为官，没有皇上的信任、满蒙亲贵的支持，要办大事是不可能的。",
      "totalCount": 1652
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 31357236,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_202_4581-4613",
      "chapterUid": 202,
      "range": "4581-4613",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "他还特为提到一个名叫詹天佑的少年，称赞这孩子是个天资非凡的英才。",
      "totalCount": 1615
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 261015533,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_72_545-577",
      "chapterUid": 72,
      "range": "545-577",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "如果不了解朝廷的真实意图，再好的作为行事，都有可能成为瞎碰乱撞。",
      "totalCount": 1584
    },
    {
      "bookId": "534288",
      "userVid": 16647713,
      "bookmarkId": "534288_200_6276-6349",
      "chapterUid": 200,
      "range": "6276-6349",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你本事虽大，但不能居全功，要让一半与天。这‘天’就是指的运气。这样看，这样想，就可以免去许多烦恼，少生许多闷气，这不仅是处世之道，也是养生之方。”",
      "totalCount": 1534
    }
